    "title": "HRC Tickets",
    "description": "Search Events \r\nWith Wannago?\u2019s HRC Tickets app you can find HRC signature events near you. \r\n\r\nBuy and Manage Tickets \r\nBuy tickets to HRC signature events in a few simple steps. Access your digital tickets from the app (Google Passbook support coming soon). \r\n\r\nInvite Friends & Family \r\nInvite friends and family to an event two ways: by sending an invite link at the end of the ticket purchase process or have them scan the QR code on your digital ticket. \r\n\r\nAbout HRC \r\nBy inspiring and engaging individuals and communities, the Human Rights Campaign strives to end discrimination against LGBTQ people and realize a world that achieves fundamental fairness and equality for all. HRC envisions a world where lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender and queer people are ensured equality and embraced as full members of society at home, at work and in every community.",
